  "question": {
    "text": "The sum of all the values of <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> such that the lines <math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math><mn>2</mn><mi>λ</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> cannot form a triangle is"
